  m_Name: StartPage
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: BoundSpiritRuntime::JournalPage
  leftPageText: 'To whom it may concern, you are dead.

    Any ghost will need to
    learn and adapt, as things will be very different.

    I, too, was a fresh ghost
    once. I have recorded my findings for you to learn from.'
  rightPageText: 'CLICKABLE COMPONENTS:

    Some puzzles will require you to use
    your hands to get dirty. You can use your cursor to click and drag components
    in some puzzles. You will only ever need to click things that show up in a popup.

'
